  "description": "Welcome to the most enchanting workshop in the kingdom! Are you ready to turn a humble garden into a bustling, bubbling business? In this cosy management adventure, you’ll step into the paws (or ears!) of a talented alchemist determined to brew the best elixirs in the land.\n\nMeet Your Furry Founders\nChoose your hero! Play as a clever Cat or a spunky Rabbit. While you’re busy in the lab, your partner handles the local Bazaar, stocking up on seeds and essentials. Together, you’ll manage three vibrant locations: the bustling Bazaar, the tranquil Farmlands, and your high-tech Alchemy Laboratory.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate Alchemist? Grab your apron—it’s time to get brewing!\n\nFeatures to Enchant You:\n- 50 Levels of Progression: Watch your empire grow from a small shed to a massive production line.\n- Cosy Vibes: Start your day at your own pace. Prep your shop in the morning sun before the doors open and the rush begins.\n- Deep Customisation: Choose which upgrades to prioritise to fit your playstyle.\n- Endless Fun: Even after hitting level 50, the challenge continues as orders get more complex and your factory reaches peak efficiency.\n",
